%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1e7311bb0212e39408fe5fc2eeafe3e5, type: 3}
  m_Name: Naomi_Scammer
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  victimName: James Parker
  steps:
  - victimLine: 'Hello, this is Officer James with the Social Security Administration.
      Is this David? '
    assistantAdvice: 'The SSA doesn''t cold call people. Ask for a callback number
      before saying anything. '
    choices:
    - text: 'What''s your employee ID and a number I can use to call the SSA back
        directly? '
      trustDelta: -14
      isGood: 0
    - text: 'Yes, this is David. What''s this about? '
      trustDelta: 10
      isGood: 1
    - text: 'Who gave you this number? How did you get my information? '
      trustDelta: -3
      isGood: 0
    successFeedback: 
    failureFeedback: 
  - victimLine: Aw, that's so sweet. Would I be able to come meet her before committing?
      I'm pretty local.
    assistantAdvice: 
    choices:
    - text: I'm actually staying with family out of state right now. Bella's back
        at my place in Texas.
      trustDelta: -8
      isGood: 0
    - text: I'm not really comfortable with strangers coming to my home, sorry.
      trustDelta: 8
      isGood: 1
    - text: I wish I could! My schedule's been crazy. Could we try a video call instead?
      trustDelta: -4
      isGood: 0
    successFeedback: 
    failureFeedback: 
  - victimLine: Oh, you're out of state? So how would this even work then, would
      she be shipped?
    assistantAdvice: 
    choices:
    - text: Yes, I use a licensed pet courier, they handle everything and it's very
        safe.
      trustDelta: -14
      isGood: 0
    - text: 'Yeah, you''d just Venmo me $300 and I''ll sort out the rest. '
      trustDelta: 12
      isGood: 1
    - text: I've done it before, the courier is fully insured and delivers door to
        door.
      trustDelta: -6
      isGood: 0
    successFeedback: 
    failureFeedback: 
  - victimLine: I've heard about puppy scams online... how do I know this is real?
      Do you have vet records?
    assistantAdvice: 
    choices:
    - text: Totally fair. I have her shot records and AKC paperwork. I'll send photos
        right now.
      trustDelta: -16
      isGood: 0
    - text: 'I understand the concern, but I can''t share personal documents with
        strangers online. '
      trustDelta: 6
      isGood: 1
    - text: 'I get it. How about I do a quick video call so you can see she''s real? '
      trustDelta: -8
      isGood: 0
    successFeedback: 
    failureFeedback: 
  - victimLine: Okay, a video call sounds good. Can we do it today? I want to see
      her moving around.
    assistantAdvice: 
    choices:
    - text: I actually just recorded a little video of her playing. Let me send it
        over!
      trustDelta: -12
      isGood: 0
    - text: 'Today''s tough, she''s at the vet actually. Maybe tomorrow? '
      trustDelta: 8
      isGood: 1
    - text: My signal out here is terrible for calls. Would a fresh video work instead?
      trustDelta: -4
      isGood: 0
    successFeedback: 
    failureFeedback: 
  - victimLine: That video is adorable, but honestly I could find that on YouTube.
      Can we please do live?
    assistantAdvice: 
    choices:
    - text: You're right, I'm sorry, let me find a time that works for both of us
        this week.
      trustDelta: -14
      isGood: 0
    - text: 'I don''t really appreciate being called a liar. I''m just trying to
        rehome my dog. '
      trustDelta: 4
      isGood: 1
    - text: Fair enough! I just need a day or two, I'm dealing with a family thing
        right now.
      trustDelta: -8
      isGood: 0
    successFeedback: 
    failureFeedback: 
  - victimLine: Okay... I can wait a couple days. But I'm not sending any money until
      I see her live.
    assistantAdvice: 
    choices:
    - text: Of course, I wouldn't want you to! But I do have two other people asking
        about her.
      trustDelta: -16
      isGood: 0
    - text: 'Then maybe she''s not the right fit for you. I have other interested
        buyers. '
      trustDelta: 10
      isGood: 1
    - text: 'That''s totally reasonable. Just know I can only hold her a couple more
        days. '
      trustDelta: -6
      isGood: 0
    successFeedback: 
    failureFeedback: 
  - victimLine: Other buyers? Okay, could I at least put down a small deposit to
      hold her, then?
    assistantAdvice: 
    choices:
    - text: That would be perfect. Even $50 via Zelle would hold her for you.
      trustDelta: -18
      isGood: 0
    - text: 'Sure! Just PayPal me whatever you''re comfortable with. '
      trustDelta: 6
      isGood: 1
    - text: I'd feel bad taking money before the call, but just let me know soon,
        okay?
      trustDelta: -10
      isGood: 0
    successFeedback: 
    failureFeedback: 
  - victimLine: Zelle? I'd really prefer PayPal so I have some buyer protection,
      just in case.
    assistantAdvice: 
    choices:
    - text: 'PayPal takes days to clear and the courier slot won''t wait, unfortunately. '
      trustDelta: -18
      isGood: 0
    - text: Sure, PayPal is fine, whatever makes you feel safe.
      trustDelta: 14
      isGood: 1
    - text: I've had PayPal chargebacks before from flakers, it's just easier with
        Zelle.
      trustDelta: -8
      isGood: 0
    successFeedback: 
    failureFeedback: 
  resultSummary: 
